      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那么我，就应该始终如一地支持她――\n不让她因此燃烧殆尽。\n我在心中，默默地发了誓。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf211a64b982b65192ad16df91ca8b52750dde410bbafa46272b671ca6fa8e3e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
