    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f684d9380a78a2bf545f7d0c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "谷水琴蕾为了MC路线，给自己的压力\n有些过大了。看到她的疲劳，\n无论如何我都想让她休息――",
      "source_fingerprint": "41b8379d8046e56a9821474bfda47bc6293414ae21e563f36e5dace2a5a31fd2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
