      "source_text": "是啊……但是，我明白了残月为何物。\n享受破案的过程，满足――\n是一种给出答案的酩酊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "16727ac3320d1408609f4eef718f7dcfb3c60d0b3b80480df897ccbc305c4803",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
