      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『哈——哈哈！　你懂我的艺术！\n――就为你献上一句，\n“感谢你的购买”吧！』",
      "source_fingerprint": "059f60c15ef8a9fda8edf48ed7d178b469589458b9daafeb239bf6992db0b0e7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
